<title>UK: Bluebird Toys buys back shares at 149.5p/shr.</title>
<headline>Bluebird Toys buys back shares at 149.5p/shr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bluebird Toys Plc said it bought back three million shares, reprsenting 6.59 percent of its issued share capital, at 149.50 pence per share.  </p>
<p>Bluebird Toys earlier today announced plans for a share buy back, handled by SBC Warburg, following the general authority granted at its annual meeting this year.</p>
<p>Bluebird shares gained five pence to trade at 145-1/2 by 1228 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
